  "_source": "Port of ~/.claude/skills/_shared/scripts/core/models.py (MODEL_MAP / CANONICAL / CAPS) with the M0 corrections from spikes/higgsfield/REPORT.md §5 (2026-10-09, higgsfield CLI 1.1.23): gpt_image_2 accepts 21:9 (+auto, 4:5, 5:4); gpt_image_2_5 accepts auto; seedance_2_0 has mode std|fast (fast = 480p/720p only); seedance_2_5 and cinematic_studio_video_4_0 have mode t2v|omni_reference|video_edit|video_extension and REQUIRE mode omni_reference for start/end/reference images (max 30 images, 50 media total); cinematic_studio_soul_cast/_location also accept 5:4 and 4:5; nano_banana_2 is a server alias of nano_banana_pro (canonical job_type); video_upscale is read via `model get` (not workflow); upscaler `refs` means video_references. Values are copied from `higgsfield model get <id>` / `workflow get <id>` — never guessed. Verify with the app's `doctor --models`.",
